            "review_title": "Review at Bò Né Ông Tùng",
            "review_text": "Maria M\n1 contribution\n0\nAwesomeness\nOct 2026 • Couples\nLocation is only on our doorstep from Prague Hotel, atmosphere is very homely like they seem to know you on Day 1,Food is like homemade food and very fresh and clean . Service is excellent , special mention to Thu Hoa who talks to us in English and even took us to local market on her free time . She’s highly commendable for taking extra time and effort to make our dine in experience and our stay in Ho Chi Minh more memorable.\nRead more\nInsider tip:\nTheir breakfast buffet is really fresh and yummy\nValue\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nWritten October 5, 2026",
            "rating": 5.0,
